"iCalendar standard; this option works around one of them. If you have "
"problems with Outlook users not being able to get your invitations, try "
"setting this option."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft Outlook ima niz nedostataka u provedbi iCalendar stadarda; ova "
"opciju radi oko jedne od njih. Ako imate problema s korisnicima programa "
